{
     "Version": "2012-10-17",
     "Statement": [
       {
         "Effect": "Allow",
         "Action": ["s3:GetObject", "s3:ListBucket"],
         "Resource": [
           "arn:aws:s3:::corp-data-lake",
           "arn:aws:s3:::corp-data-lake/tenants/tenant_A/*"
         ],
         "Condition": {
           "StringLike": {"s3:prefix": ["tenants/tenant_A/*", "tenants/tenant_A"]}
         }
       }
     ]
   }
   ```
Even if an attacker successfully prompt-injects the agent and forces it to query `s3://corp-data-lake/tenants/tenant_B/financials.xlsx`, AWS's identity tier enforces hard rejection at the cloud fabric layer.

